# 🤖 Algorithmic Forex & Index Trading Bot

A fully automated, cloud-deployed trading bot built in Python, integrated with the **Capital.com API**, running four live strategies across forex pairs and indices. Includes real-time Telegram alerts and a custom Flask monitoring dashboard.

---

## 🚀 Live Strategies

| Instrument | Strategy | Description |
|------------|----------|-------------|
| **US500** | Opening Range Breakout (ORB) | Captures breakout from the first 30-min candle at market open |
| **EURUSD** | Asian Range Breakout | Enters on London open breakout of the Asian session high/low |
| **GBPUSD** | Asian Range Breakout | Same logic applied to cable at London open |
| **USDJPY** | Previous Day High/Low Breakout | Enters on break of prior day's key levels |

---

