---

## 🧠 Risk Management (Shared Across All Instruments)

- **Position sizing:** 1% risk per trade, calculated dynamically from account equity
- **Auto-moving Stop Loss:** SL moves to TP1 when TP1 is hit (trade becomes risk-free), then closes at TP2
- **Daily loss limit:** Bot pauses if daily drawdown exceeds threshold
- **News filter:** Skips trading around high-impact economic events
- **Rate limiting:** Built-in sleep delays to respect API rate limits

---

## 📊 Flask Dashboard Features

- Real-time equity curve
- Open trades with live P&L
- Per-pair performance statistics
- Portfolio heat map
- Live bot logs

